# Model checkpoints and representation caches produced by the experiment scripts.
# ~5.3 GB across ~112 files; the JSON run records next to them are what the paper
# actually reads (scripts/cell_matrix.py globs *.json), so those ARE tracked.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
results/**/reps_cache.npz

# Peer-review correspondence: reviewer comments, meta-reviews and our responses.
# This repository is public; review material is confidential to the venue.
paper_8/official_comment_*.md
paper_8/response_reviewer*.md
paper_8/rebuttal_round*.md
paper_8/*review_map.md

# latexmk dependency database. Regenerated by every build and records absolute
# paths from this machine, so it is noise in a diff and leaks local layout.
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

# The extra-identifier list for scripts/check_anonymity.py. Untracked by design: it is the one file
# in the tree that writes the author's identifiers down, so shipping it would defeat the check that
# reads it.
.anonymity_terms

# The supplementary bundle is a build artifact: scripts/make_supplementary.py regenerates it
# from "git archive" at a named commit, so committing it would store the repo inside itself.
supplementary.zip
